00:15:46,900 --> 00:15:55,620
You can also use the buttons below to select all, non or interesting syncs.

152
00:15:56,360 --> 00:15:59,700
Make sure you click the save button to save your choices.

153
00:16:02,080 --> 00:16:04,220
You can also do the same with sources.

154
00:16:04,440 --> 00:16:09,480
So if we open up the cog again and click on the sources tab in the general settings,

155
00:16:10,240 --> 00:16:15,640
